{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中，姚子羚（Elaine）飾演的外剛內柔女強人藍鳳儀備受關注！昨晚（17日）她被強拍裸照的戲份相當震撼，為求逼真更搏命演出，加上其「又帥又美」的西裝造型，成功俘虜大批觀眾。究竟這位知性美女背後付出了多少努力？\n</p>\n<h2>姚子羚被強拍裸照 搏命演出真撼落牆</h2>\n<p>昨晚劇情焦點之一，是姚子羚飾演的藍鳳儀被猛男捉入公廁強拍裸照，場面極具衝擊力。為了拍出被暴力對待的真實感，子羚完全豁出去，不但親身上陣，更應劇情需要「撼落牆」，而且為了捕捉最佳效果，單是這個鏡頭就拍了足足6、7 Take，其專業精神和搏命態度，讓觀眾看得既心痛又佩服，成功將角色的無助與驚恐演繹得淋漓盡致。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚爆首日開工趣事 陳豪大讚：你進步咗呀</h2>\n<p>姚子羚在劇中與陳豪有大量對手戲，她接受TVB.com訪問時，就分享了與視帝開工的趣事。她透露首天開工時，陳豪便對她說：「『子羚你進步咗呀！』跟住我話：『陳Mo，好多年喇，冇進步死得啦！』」子羚更笑言自己一向覺得陳豪很正，所以更容易投入角色，大讚二人合作有默契：「大家亦都唔需要講出嚟就知大家會點樣做。」</p>\n<h2>劇中陷暗戀三角錯 姚子羚外剛內柔勁吸睛</h2>\n<p>除了演技備受肯定，姚子羚在劇中的感情線亦是網民討論的焦點。她飾演的藍鳳儀周旋於上司陳雲生（陳豪飾）與好友（張頴康飾）之間，形成一段虐心的「暗戀三角錯」。這個設定大大豐富了角色的層次，讓觀眾看到這位外表剛強的「知性女強人」內心柔軟脆弱的一面，大大提升了角色的吸引力。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚微表情到位 封姚子羚「西裝美女」</h2>\n<p>姚子羚在《玫瑰戰爭》中的演出雖然沒有太多情緒大爆發的場口，但其沉穩內斂的演繹方式深受網民喜愛，大讚她「微表情到位」兼「演得很有層次」。同時，她劇中多變的西裝造型亦引起熱話，網民激讚她「又帥又美」，更封她為「TVB掌管西裝的神」，紛紛留言：「慘同奸都得」、「可鹽可甜」、「氣質西裝美女」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_13705894806afd2b307aaee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_13705894806afd2b307aaee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_8139993676afd2b39552c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_8139993676afd2b39552c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_20472646866afd2b4015f4b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_20472646866afd2b4015f4b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_7403990106afd2b45ea688.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_7403990106afd2b45ea688.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/47_9831746196afd2b4c60088.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/47_9831746196afd2b4c60088.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_14041689286afd2b56415ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/48_14041689286afd2b56415ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/49_16202411806afd2b5d4a275.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/49_16202411806afd2b5d4a275.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/50_8081268376afd2b6449abe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/50_8081268376afd2b6449abe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/51_14420977616afd2b6a644ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/51_14420977616afd2b6a644ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.537830+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1093,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:38:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:28.894736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:32.836421+00:00",